# Code Style Consistency

Before generating code, analyze the codebase for:
- Naming conventions (camelCase for variables, PascalCase for classes)
- Indentation (2 spaces)
- Import organization
- Functional vs OOP usage

Adapt new code to match existing patterns. Prefer libraries already in use. Structure new modules to mirror similar existing modules.
